# CHIEF.md template (design 5.9)
#
# The live file holds exactly one content line: the current chief, or a
# vacancy. Overwritten (not appended) on handover or when a vacancy is
# noticed (design: "Overwritten on handover or when a vacancy is noticed").
#
# Named chief:
#   chief=<session-id> named-by=<founder-or-session> named-at=<ISO8601>
#
# Vacant (design C5 — "whoever notices first marks VACANT since <ts>"):
#   VACANT since <ISO8601>
#
# Example (named):
chief=team-lead-main named-by=founder named-at=2026-09-25T09:00:00Z

# Example (vacant) — replace the whole file with this shape instead when
# a chief's session ends without handover:
# VACANT since 2026-09-25T09:00:00Z
